  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "p01",
      "visual": "portal",
      "from": 0,
      "duration": 270,
      "text": {
        "en": "Let’s take Claude Fable 5.1 and GPT-6-Astra back to 1957 for an AI speed race!",
        "zh": "我们带上 Claude Fable 5.1 和 GPT-6-Astra，穿越到一九五七年，来场模型速度大比拼！"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "p02",
      "visual": "race",
      "from": 270,
      "duration": 174,
      "text": {
        "en": "Four programs get the same seven. X finishes almost instantly.",
        "zh": "同一张七，四位选手一起认。X 一开始就答完了。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "p03",
      "visual": "speed",
      "from": 444,
      "duration": 194,
      "text": {
        "en": "Just 0.37 microseconds per picture. All ten test pictures correct.",
        "zh": "每张只要0.37微秒。十张测试图，全都答对。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "p04",
      "visual": "ratios",
      "from": 638,
      "duration": 259,
      "text": {
        "en": "3 million times faster than Claude Fable 5.1, and 10 million times faster than GPT-6-Astra!",
        "zh": "比 Claude Fable 5.1 快300万倍，比 GPT-6-Astra 快1000万倍！"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "p05",
      "visual": "reveal",
      "from": 897,
      "duration": 198,
      "text": {
        "en": "Meet the perceptron: a 1957 idea, using just 400 points.",
        "zh": "这就是感知机。一九五七年的思路，只有四百个分数。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "p06",
      "visual": "add",
      "from": 1095,
      "duration": 159,
      "text": {
        "en": "Add the black squares’ points. Enough points means yes.",
        "zh": "把黑格子的分数加起来，够了就回答“是”。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "p07",
      "visual": "train",
      "from": 1254,
      "duration": 180,
      "text": {
        "en": "It learned from 419 examples, adjusting those points along the way.",
        "zh": "四百一十九张例子，让它把这些分数一点点调好。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "p08",
      "visual": "scope",
      "from": 1434,
      "duration": 135,
      "text": {
        "en": "Winning this specialized speed test doesn’t make it smarter overall.",
        "zh": "专项任务跑得快，不代表整体能力更强。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "p09",
      "visual": "family",
      "from": 1569,
      "duration": 144,
      "text": {
        "en": "Grid paper, a few pencils, and you can try training one with your child.",
        "zh": "格子纸，几支笔，你和孩子也能训练一个。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "p10",
      "visual": "matrix",
      "from": 1713,
      "duration": 233,
      "text": {
        "en": "That weighted sum can be written as matrix multiplication, one of today’s basic AI operations.",
        "zh": "刚才的加权求和，可以写成矩阵相乘。这也是今天 AI 的基础运算。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "p11",
      "visual": "invite",
      "from": 1946,
      "duration": 282,
      "text": {
        "en": "At Lucas Academy, we learn step by step. What would you teach AI?",
        "zh": "在 Lucas Academy，我们一起一点一点学。你想让 AI 学会什么？"
      }
    }
  ],
